# PSR-4b-whyDenali-alias-expiry — dual-read closed

## Prerequisite proof

| Check | Result |
| --- | --- |
| All guestLanding manifests use `whySection` | Yes (denali, urban, guest-club, harbor) |
| Any manifest still declares `whyDenali` | **None** |
| Narrative docs teach `whySection` | Yes ([`psr-4b-whyDenali-docs`](./psr-4b-whyDenali-docs.mdoc)) |

Compatibility window is therefore closed without breaking live manifests.

## Scope

| Work | Done |
| --- | --- |
| `resolveGuestLandingWhySectionGate` — require `whySection` only | Yes |
| Reject manifests that still declare `whyDenali` | Yes |
| Smoke: forbid `whyDenali` key under guestLanding.sections | Yes |
| Unit coverage for reject/accept paths | Yes |
| CSS `data-marketing-home-why*` rename | **No** (already product-neutral) |

## Gate resolver after this wave

```text
whySection boolean required
whyDenali present → fail closed (alias expired)
neither → fail closed
```

## Ratchet

```bash
node scripts/ops/psr-4b-whyDenali-alias-expiry-smoke.mjs
node scripts/ops/psr-4b-whyDenali-smoke.mjs
node --test scripts/test/guest-landing-why-section-gate.spec.mjs
```

Land commit: `8d64664c`

## Explicit non-goals

- Fixture finance/booking API dep split
- PSR-5 data authority
- Rewriting ENTERPRISE_AUDIT_REPORT historical findings
